  "details": "Previously, the world launch page for an instance would obviously show people to the full world details allowing them to see the world preview video, details and favorite it.\n\nnow, this has been relegated to a small button of the same color as everything else, which makes it a lot less obvious, breaks muscle memory / habits of many years and leads to a potential confusion / loss of conversation rate for world creators when links are shared for instances instead of worlds by unknowing users.\n\nPlease revert this behavior by making the title also obviously link to the full world page as it always was, thank you.",
